  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "One of the concerns about the newly introduced Guided Mode is that it omits detailed search abilities. I can understand itself as an intended feature. But many Japanese users worry about throwing newcomers into a random world with an unfamiliar language environment, that is, English in many cases, as they might give up continuing to use VRChat.\n\nSo I suggest filtering worlds by language. Since the language selection exists in the user profile, I believe it is possible to match the player's and users' languages in the instances.\n\n- I don't care if it is explicit filtering or implicit one.\n\n- It might be helpful in normal mode too.\n\n- Related old post https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/active-by-language-world-rows",
